SUMMARY:Alumni SUDS
DESCRIPTION:Alumni SUDS is BACK! Join us on Friday\, September 25 to raise a pint\, reconnect and celebrate what makes Skule™ unforgettable. \nThis event is proudly organized by students who are excited to welcome alumni back to campus. \nEvent details: \n\nDate: Friday\, September 25\, 2026\nTime: 6:00 – 10:30 p.m.\nLocation: EngSoc Arena* (Myhal Centre basement)\, 55 St. George Street\n*SUDS has temporarily moved to the Myhal Centre while the Sanford Fleming Pit undergoes renovations.\n\n LGMB is crashing the party between 8-9 p.m.\n Engineering Stores will be open for business\n Alumni who pre-register and arrive between 6:00 p.m.- 8:00 p.m. will receive a free slice of pizza! \n Register now\n Spread the word through your networks! \n\n\nQuestions? \n\n\nEmail alumni.relations@engineering.utoronto.ca
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/alumni-suds-2/
LOCATION:55 St. George Street
CATEGORIES:Socials
END:VEVENT
